        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知某连续LTI系统的零、极点分布如图所示， $h(0_{+})=6$ ，",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            144,
            660,
            161
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 求系统的系统函数 $H(s)$ , 如果系统是因果系统, 判断其稳定性;",
        "bbox": [
            153,
            172,
            758,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 写出该系统的微分方程。",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            200,
            418,
            218
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 由零极点图可列",
        "bbox": [
            612,
            205,
            844,
            242
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/66bce2eca34584cd77bce7e62ee8901af0dc954418eddeb4d9aab98136c6fd68.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            367,
            226,
            611,
            350
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (S) = \\frac {k S}{(s + 1) (s + 2)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            645,
            256,
            828,
            309
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh (0 + 1) = \\lim _ {s \\to \\infty} s H (s) = \\frac {k s ^ {2}}{s ^ {2} + 3 s + 2} = k = 6\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            633,
            302,
            991,
            361
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $H(s)=\\frac{6s}{s^{2}+3s+2}=\\frac{y(s)}{f(s)}$",
        "bbox": [
            63,
            368,
            372,
            426
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nS ^ {2} f (s) + 3 S f (s) + 2 f (s) = 6 S F (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            73,
            442,
            410,
            484
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则方程为 $y'(t) + 3y'(t) + 2y'(t) = 6f'(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            19,
            489,
            382,
            541
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $H(S)=\\frac{6S}{(S+1)(S+2)}$",
        "bbox": [
            611,
            380,
            825,
            434
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若系统因导则 ROC 为 $\\sigma > -1$ 说明 ROC 内包含应轴. 故系统稳定",
