    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 分程 $9^{i}(t)=f(t)-59^{i}(t)-69^{i}(t)$ $\\Rightarrow f(t)=9^{i}(t)+59^{i}(t)+69^{i}(t)$ $y(t)=29^{i}(t)+9^{i}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            679,
            164,
