            265
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $H(S)=\\frac{2S+1}{(S+2)(S+3)}=\\frac{-3}{S+2}+\\frac{5}{S+3}$",
        "bbox": [
            21,
