    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {H (w)} & {= H (s) / s = j w = \\frac {j w + 2}{- w ^ {2} + 1 2 + 7 j w}} \\\\ {| H (w) |} & {= \\frac {\\sqrt {w ^ {2} + 4}}{\\sqrt {(- w ^ {2} + 1 2) ^ {2} + 4 9 w ^ {2}}} = \\frac {\\sqrt {w ^ {2} + 4}}{\\sqrt {w ^ {4} + 2 5 w ^ {2} + 1 4 4}}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
