    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $r_{2i}(t+1)$ 申 $B = \\frac{2}{7} \\times 20 = \\frac{40}{7}$ , $A = 2 - \\frac{40}{7} = -\\frac{26}{7} \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{2} i, |t| = \\left(-\\frac{26}{7} e^{-\\sqrt{t} + \\frac{40}{7} e^{-\\frac{3}{2}}} t\\right)$ 官网：www.tongxinkaoyan.com $R_{2S}(s) = H(S) \\cdot E(S) = \\frac{3(2S - 2S)}{(s + 3)(s + 5)(s + \\frac{3}{2})} = \\frac{31}{s + 3} + \\frac{-15}{s + 5} + \\frac{-16}{s + \\frac{3}{2}}$ $\\Rightarrow r_{2S}(t) = (31e^{-3t} - 15e^{-5t} - 16e^{-\\frac{3}{2}t})$ 梦马班作业\n\nPDF免费QQ群615698143",
